openCowOrder
├── Given unauthorized, paused, expired or unbound module
│   └── It reverts without state advance
├── Given reward ETH or ysy principal ETH
│   ├── It debits only pendingEth[0] or pendingEth[2]
│   └── Cap, custody deficit or unexpected ETH return reverts atomically
├── Given supporter or protocol rETH harvested carry
│   ├── It debits only matching harvestInventory bucket
│   └── Missing inventory, cap or wrong actual spend reverts atomically
└── Given deprecated synchronous DEX routes
    └── They require asynchronous intents instead
